# api-extractor scratch output. The golden report in each package's etc/ is
# committed; temp/ is regenerated on every run.
temp/

# Planning artifacts (plans, per-task reports, ledgers) written while a branch
# is being built. Deliberately untracked: they describe how the work was
# arrived at, and the repo's own record of that is the commits, the changesets
# and DESIGN.md. Ignored rather than merely uncommitted so one `git add -A`
# cannot fold a working notebook into the published history.
docs/superpowers/
